                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1115/10–2448: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-10-24T15:00:00+08:00">October 24, 1948—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 24—5:46 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1984. With reference Deptel 1484, October 23, repeated Peiping 188 and Tientsin
                    197, we feel Embtel October 23 sent Peiping 189 and Tientsin 173; repeated
                    Department 1980 adequately meets situation. Sent Department 1984, repeated
                    Peiping 192, Tientsin 175.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
